{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Domain\" title=\"Domain\">domain</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/147bf79bf2e42219cf408d367f31eb3171b31f51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\sqrt{4+2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed90c6307eeded48f8d1eaac79fa8343e0b30cfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ (-2,+\\infty)\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ [0,+\\infty)\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ [-2,+\\infty)\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ [-2,0]\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"575\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/556f069a13a66d2df5c5d2673bc44fa7f295bf45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> must be non-negative, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8ab0ec5027c055e1b34dc345b1d8532b611bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> must be non-negative. Therefore, all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/9235bf8697171900c8214b501055a71c2a7f9e81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ge-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> are in the domain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2484f88154fadcf9c781bba19becdae88696b77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006